    },
    {
      "x": 900,
      "y": 330,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-3",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 340,
        "h": 140,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 12,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3 · Click Compare 1 Change. This stays a PURE review: no checkboxes, no confirm bar, nothing to press."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a5Txr",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 40,
      "y": 830,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-4",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 560,
        "h": 200,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 12,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4 · Close it, then click Merge — ONE click, no arming. The SAME dialog reopens, titled \"Merge changes\", every changed element ticked, with \"› Merge 1 change\" at the bottom right. Untick Planner v2: the confirm greys out and says applying only some changes isn't supported yet."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a63Jb",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 650,
      "y": 830,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-5",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 560,
        "h": 200,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5 · Re-tick it and close. Now click the chevron beside Merge, then Rebase. The right-hand board is captioned \"<draft> (after Rebase)\" — the draft as it WOULD look, computed before anything is applied. Confirming runs the real Rebase."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a7Hq2",
      "typeName": "shape"
